First, pardon if this has been done to death. I'm working with the latest
AT&T natural voices, and trying to get the speech correct. However, I want
to use this to learn the words. Thus, I need it to quickly switch from
"English" to "Lojban". I'm using the nice rhyming gismu list that Garrett
Jones (ki'e sai) nicely provided. I can do it with a certain amount of work
using the TextAloud program I have. None of this is free, so I'm sorry about
the licensing. However, they are among the best voices I've heard. I've also
looked through many speech programs, and TextAloud is one of the best
(obviously this isn't spam-I use the stuff).

 

I remember the Lojbanistan anthem being done in speech, and I'm sure this
has been approached before. However, the latest voices have progressed since
then.

           
